# -------------------------

**pycache**/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.pyo
*.pyd
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.venv/
venv/
env/

